  "proof": [
    "Time strictly increases; complete address contains t, so no variable can be revisited on a path.",
    "In pure D/no mask/do, kappa,phi,z invariant; m may change. Entire eligible universe partitions into48 independent trajectory sectors(kappa,phi,z), each one START/m0 root, and96 structural groups(kappa,phi,z,m). Scene error/rank have no effect in this domain; each root represents120 U2 scenes.",
    "At each visited eligible declared variable, absent branch uses nominal min-index exact max action with weight1; present target uses x/r. A path with v visited variables has unread completion(1+x)^(M-v), retaining every unvisited declaration with its target probabilities and distinct full-pre multiplicity.",
    "Accept a terminal cylinder as no-trigger iff SUCCESS or no selected address was consulted. Sum disjoint cylinders with exact Fractions. Memoization combines algebraic sums, not full-pre identity, sampler rank or statistical N.",
    "Global no-trigger polynomial is product of48 sector polynomials; total coefficient binom(7551,k). Clustered no-trigger is sum96 group-restricted polynomials for k>=2; distributed is global minus clustered. Z=1-no-trigger/support. This is D-only structural result, not X/P/mixed or futurelearning.",
    "Each declared full-pre world determines exactly one path per sector. Each realized path cylinder partitions visited variables into absent or one specific target; all other declared variables complete independently. Cylinders are disjoint at their first decision divergence. Since future t strictly exceeds past t, previous queried addresses cannot be queried again; backward state only needs v and manifestation flag, while weights from past choices are outside its recurrence.",
    "Unread target sum is exactly1, hence each unread context contributes1+x even if unreachable or an unconsulted sentinel. Different complete declarations are summed with exact weight, not quotiented or replaced by one representative world. The external rank/full-pre grammar remains unchanged; no sampler reads these memo states as world identifiers.",
